              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "GiftedCurd7481"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are the best mince pies I have ever tasted. I am known in my family for my mince pies, I like a thin crust and add walnuts to my filling, which I top with a star. These are a game changer they take them to the next level. Thank you for sharing your recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2024-12-14T07:41:07.131Z"
